                                    <h2>How to Evaluate a D2C Agency in Kerala</h2>
                                    <p>1. <strong>Malayalam + English fluency</strong>.<br>2. <strong>Ayurveda + wellness category depth</strong>.<br>3. <strong>Gulf + Malayali diaspora expansion</strong>.<br>4. <strong>Traditional + modern balance</strong>.<br>5. <strong>Named senior owners</strong>.<br>6. <strong>South India + national expansion capability</strong>.<br>7. <strong>Honest disagreement</strong>.</p>
